# Docs stay in sync

When behavior or structure of the app changes, update the matching docs in the same work:

- `docs/requirements.md` — in/out of scope, user-visible rules, locked decisions
- `docs/design.md` — screens, layout, visual, flows
- `docs/architecture.md` — layers, data model, packages, stack

Only edit the sections that the change actually affects. Do not invent new v1 features in the docs. If a change contradicts a locked decision, update that decision in requirements and call it out to the user.
